SUMMARY:IVA 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:ACM International Conference on Intelligent Virtual Agents\nSta
 tus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://iva.acm.org
 /2026/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#iva-2026\nNot
 es: 26th edition\, co-located with ACII 2026 at the Puebla Convention Cen
 ter. Official pages give Sept 7-11 (welcome reception Sept 7\, paper sess
 ions Sept 8-10\, workshop\, tutorial and doctoral consortium Sept 11). Fu
 ll papers had a prior abstract step (the 2025 CFP calls it mandatory)\; b
 oth were extended from Mar 28/Apr 4 (Feb 2026 Wayback snapshot). All cuto
 ffs are 23:59 AoE. Posters were an independent 2-3 page extended-abstract
  route with optional ACM DL inclusion. Demos (adjunct proceedings\, fee) 
 are schedule-only. The accepted list shows 30 full papers\, 11 posters an
 d 7 demos\; no official acceptance rate was found. Size is an editorial e
 stimate.
CATEGORIES:Autonomous Agents & Multiagent Systems,Human-AI Interaction & De
 ployment,Natural Language Processing & LLMs
URL:https://iva.acm.org/2026/
LOCATION:Puebla\, Mexico
END:VEVENT
